/**
 * DreamHost panel iconography — traced from the real panel, not redrawn.
 *
 * Every path here was lifted verbatim from a "save page complete" capture of
 * panel.dreamhost.com/?tree=checkout.dashboard (18 Aug 2026): the navigation glyphs
 * and the wordmark out of the panel's inline SVG, the product icons and the
 * empty-cart illustration out of the checkout bundle's data-URIs. Ids are namespaced
 * per icon so masks and gradients cannot collide when several share a page, and
 * hardcoded fills (several glyphs ship fill="black") are left alone so a diff
 * against the original stays clean.
 *
 * Do not "improve" these shapes. This surface has one job — to be unmistakably the
 * hosting panel and not Remixer — and the glyphs carry half of that signal.
 *
 * Generated from the capture; the two hand-drawn stand-ins at the end are labelled.
 */


